 0C23   09DA    '----- quickstart=1 (dark.ini): drop straight into the game for
                 testing
 0C23   09DA    '----- (joeface still runs -- it LOADS the 8 standing player sp
                rites)
 0C23   09DA    IF qkon <> 0 THEN GOSUB joeface: GOTO qstart
 0C44   09DA    
 0C44   09DA    '----- title screen
 0C44   09DA    SCREEN 1
 0C44   09DA    PALETTE 3, 0
 0C44   09DA    LOCATE 10, 12
